es-last-second-call-start-qb-keelon-russell","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Maryland QB Malik Washington doesn't start vs. Wisconsin","description":"Maryland quarterback Malik Washington did not start against Wisconsin as he continues to deal with a lower-body injury.","published":"2026-11-14T17:50:19.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50480722/source-maryland-qb-malik-washington-start-vs-wisconsin","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Colorado upsets No. 14 Houston for first AP top-15 win since 2007","description":"Colorado posted its first victory over an AP top-15 team since 2007 in beating No. 14 Houston 42-32 and slightly cooled down the hot seat for coach Deion Sanders.","published":"2026-11-14T14:22:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50479172/colorado-upsets-no-14-houston-1st-ap-top-15-win-2007","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Ole Miss-Oklahoma bumped to Sunday despite Sooners AD's 'strong objection'","description":"Oklahoma AD Roger Denny was critical of the SEC's decision to move the Sooners' home game against Ole Miss to Sunday following Friday's nationwide ground stop.","published":"2026-11-14T17:36:21.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50478281/ole-miss-oklahoma-bumped-sunday-sooners-ad-rips-decision","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Paolo Uggetti","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"UCLA QB Ty Dieffenbach says first-half shoulder injury vs. Illinois not serious","description":"UCLA starting quarterback Ty Dieffenbach exited because of a shoulder injury late in the second quarter but returned to lead the Bruins past Illinois 22-14.","published":"2026-11-14T17:06:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50477249/ucla-qb-ty-dieffenbach-leaves-game-injury","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Paolo Uggetti","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Wake Forest claims 'Bachelor U' status after Sam Hartman news","description":"Wake Forest football is the only program, the school says, to have had three former players feature in \"The Bachelor\" franchise.","published":"2026-11-13T23:57:20.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50475193/sam-hartman-bachelor-wake-forest","type":"Story","byline":"J.J. Post","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"FAA ground stop throws sports world into travel chaos ahead of weekend games","description":"Travel plans for teams in multiple sports were disrupted by the FAA's nationwide ground stop of all flights because of communications problems.","published":"2026-11-14T15:50:35.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50475169/faa-ground-stop-disrupting-travel-college-football-teams","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5132635/jayden-jackson","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jayden_Jackson"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Jayden Jackson","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jayden_Jackson","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:15Z","intro":"Jayden Jackson is an American college football defensive tackle for the Oklahoma Sooners.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Jackson attended IMG Academy in Bradenton, Florida. He was selected to play in the 2024 Polynesian Bowl. He committed to the University of Oklahoma to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Jackson entered his true freshman season at Oklahoma in 2024 as a starter becoming the first true freshman defensive lineman to start for the Sooners since Tommie Harris in 2001. Overall, he started 10 of 13 games, recording 30 tackles and two sacks. He returned to Oklahoma for his sophomore year in 2025."}]}}